      "en": "For the king trusts in the LORD. Through the loving kindness of the Most High, he shall not be moved.",
      "ko": "왕이 여호와를 의지하오니 지극히 높으신 자의 인자함으로 요동치 아니하리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "c6d0f24edf0a31bcf30aac2ad9e5969d0e41b4d69dc6e0ddfb9f388d6e93a3d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1c7260572a653a56763d24eb54d51fb9692ef49df60313ec994e093f59b5c72",
